      ":question/worked-solution": "Of the given options, the only one where we can draw the graph of the function without taking our pencil off of the paper in a neighborhood of $x=4$ is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186068695/plots/b9bb78861998e90b319acb99e2ee4a87903892eafbef952ea5df22182d8f9652.png)\n\nAll other given options have breaks or asymptotes at $x=4$, so it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=4$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.",
